rows.original:
Your dungeons are [wayfort.hasPrisoners
    |occupied and under guard
    |conspicuously empty, although they've been kept swept and clean
]. The simple barred stone cells are outfitted with padded wooden benches, and a hatch for food, water, and 'personal hygiene' supplies can be delivered and retrieved. Wardings stamped into the stone in plates of electrum help to keep anyone from shapeshifting or teleporting their way out, although a sufficiently-overpowering monster may be able to disregard these protections.

[alissa.atWayfort
    |Alissa, former queen of the boreal elves, is brooding in her dungeon cell. No amount of corrupted physical strength or demonic magic will free her from the runic bindings holding her, and she's clearly exhausted her efforts to break free already. And so, she stalks around the edges of the cell like a caged predator, [alissa.isDisguised|bare elven feet silently padding|bovine hooves clopping] across the stone. She glances at you often, and you aren't entirely sure if it's a look of wariness, or hunger... 
]

[dragoon.atWayfort
    |[dragoon.isGytha
        |Gytha, now Alissa's demonic dragoon, is sitting [alissa.atWayfort|as close to her queen's cell as she can|in the back of her cell, awaiting your judgement silently].
        |Melara, Alissa's demonic dragoon, is still in her cell. She's sitting at ease on the bedside, watching you with quiet anticipation.
    ]
]

[corlup.imprisoned
    |Due to the sheer number of corrupted lupines being detained, and the limited amount of cells to hold them all, it's clear that the guards were forced to make the difficult choice of having numerous wolfmen share a cell with one another. The one exception being their ex-jarl. He has been made to sit alone in his cell.
]

rows.translation:
你的地牢[wayfort.hasPrisoners
    |已被占领且有人把守
    |尽管这些地方一直被保持得整洁干净，但它们显然空无一人。
]这些简单的石制牢房内配备了软垫木制长凳，同时设有用于投放和取回食物、水以及“个人卫生用品”的舱口。刻在石墙上的电银色铭文能够有效阻止任何人通过变形或传送术逃脱，不过那些实力强大的怪物或许能够无视这些防护措施。

[alissa.atWayfort
    |艾莉莎，这位曾经统治北方精灵的女王，如今正在她地牢的牢房里郁郁寡欢。无论她的力量多么强横，也不管她的恶魔魔法多么厉害，都无法挣脱那些束缚她的符文枷锁。显然，她已经用尽了所有尝试逃脱的努力。于是，她就像一只被关在笼子里的猛兽一样，在牢房的角落里来回徘徊。 [alissa.isDisguised|赤脚的精灵悄无声息地移动着。|牛蹄声阵阵]穿过那块石头。她经常会瞥向你，而你并不完全确定，那是一种警惕的眼神，还是一种渴望…… 
]

[dragoon.atWayfort
    |[dragoon.isGytha
        |吉莎，如今已成为艾莉莎的恶魔龙骑兵，正坐在那里[alissa.atWayfort|尽可能靠近她女王的巢穴|在她的牢房里，默默地等待着你的判决]。
        |梅拉拉，艾莉莎那头恶魔龙骑兵，仍然被关在她的牢房里。她安静地坐在床边，以一种充满期待的眼神注视着你。
    ]
]

[corlup.imprisoned
    |由于被关押的腐化狼人数量庞大，而用于关押他们的牢房数量有限，因此守卫们显然不得不做出一个艰难的决定：让许多狼人共同关在一个牢房里。唯一的例外是他们的前首领——他被单独关在了一个牢房里。
]

rows.original:
[flags.CIRCLE_FIRE_SPIRITS
    |The temperature in the summoning circle's room skyrockets, and sweat begins to bead on your forehead while you check that the latch is neatly shut— it wouldn't do to be interrupted [wayfort.hasFreja
        |by your daughter
    ] while the hard-bodied fuck-strumpets that you call flame-summons are busy with you.

    Tails entwine, flames soar, and two very muscular salamander spirits give you their best fuck-eyes once they realize there's no fight to be had. "[pc.mf
        |Master
        |Mistress
    ]... how do you want us? Or do we get to have <b>you</b>?"
    |You walk around the summoning circle, fixing in your mind the image of the twin fire spirits at your command; the knight, and the dancer. In particular it's hard not to fixate on their tall, lean, muscular, ebony bodies. The circle itself is potent enough to anchor your summons for plenty of time; it'll be nice to experiment without being limited by combat, even if they look particularly good in action. 

    Taking a deep breath, you set your stance at the circle's edge, focus on their combined image, and drag deeply from the same place your magic comes from. There's no complicated hand gestures, nor any need to chant... it's just a moment's concentration[pc.isBimbo
        |, and even you're deliciously smoothed thinky-bits can manage a moment of thinking about hot bodies
    ].
]

