rows.original:
The two of you settle in for a long, somewhat-nervous, but mostly-cuddly wait. [wayfort.hasMaids
    |Your maids prove to be perfect, ensuring they stop by every meal time, and tell the two of you off if you don't go outside and at least do some morning exercises — with a promise to watch your egg while you're gone, for paranoia's sake. 
]Rumie, your humble beetender, makes sure to regularly visit[wayfort.hasMaids
    | as well
], with stews, soups, and sandwiches.

Your days aren't spent alone for long, however; a shadow crosses the skylight, heralding Kasyrra's arrival. "I did make sure I wouldn't be interrupting you two mid-fuck, but I think this may be lewder." The draconic demon smirks at the two of you, holding hands and cuddling a huge, leathery egg together.

rows.translation:
你们俩静静地等待着，这段等待时间有些漫长，也让人感到有些紧张，但大部分时间里，你们都紧紧地依偎在一起。 [wayfort.hasMaids
    |你的女仆们表现得非常称职，她们会在每顿饭的时间来提醒你们，如果你们不出去至少做些晨练，就会责备你们。为了防止你们担心，她们还会承诺在你们外出期间帮忙照看你们的鸡蛋。 
]露米，你这个谦逊的助手，一定会定期来访的。[wayfort.hasMaids
    | 也
]有炖菜、汤品，还有三明治。

然而，你的日子并不会长久地独自度过——天窗上突然出现了一道阴影，标志着卡希拉的到来。“我确实确保自己不会在你们做爱时打扰你们，不过我觉得这次的情况可能会更……热烈一些。”这个龙形恶魔看着你们俩手牵着手、依偎着那个巨大的皮革蛋，露出了得意的笑容。
